      55.77,
      508.14,
      298.31,
      567.21
    ],
    "text": "I, Nalaka Jude Harin Fernando, Minister of Tourism and Lands hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      580.14,
      298.34,
      663.21
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. KU/PLG/2019/420 dated 16.09.2021 prepared by the Surveyor General, having the name and the extent as mentioned below, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 949 Kotambule, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Polgahawela, in Kurunegala District, in North Western Province having boundaries as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
